      "proof": {
        "maxDimRunSeconds": 620,
        "why": "A wind-down that ENDS at zero on purpose, measured dim for 566 s: the strip is meant to be off once you are asleep. It starts bright (from 0.85), so `visible in` still applies to it at full strength."
      }
